      395.6,
      326.49,
      500.45
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire and own of the following blocks of Land for the construction of a Pumping station at left bank of Madiwela East Diversion Canal which is a sub-project under the Metro Colombo Development Project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      5.039495944976807,
      6.959303855895996,
