    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      516.31,
      286.68,
      660.08
    ],
    "text": "The undermentioned allotments of land situated in Udumulla Village belonging to Udumulla North Grama Niladhari Division in the Kolonnawa Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in the District of Colombo, Western Province made by the Surveyor General on 11.04.2017 and depicted as Lot Nos. 1 and 2 in the Preliminary Plan No. \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3. 9685 containing in extent 0.8491. 1. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Kurundugodalla Ovita alias Mahaduwa Pillewa; Land use: Home Garden; Claimant: N. Ariyarathne, No. 62, Ambathale, Mulleriyawa New Town; Extent: 0.8112",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
