      659.59,
      286.71,
      722.72
    ],
    "text": "2. Lot No. 2 Name of the Land: KurundugodallaOvita alias Mahaduwa Pillewa; Land use: Home Garden; Claimant: K. A. D. Nandasiri, No. 112, Lake Road; Udumulla, Mulleriyawa New Town; Extent: 0.0378",
